0/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/3307567149","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/45#issuecomment-3307567149","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/45","id":3307567149,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOns7hc7FJXgt","user":{"login":"ant-ms","id":23363161,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzYzMTYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23363161?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms","html_url":"https://github.com/ant-ms","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-18T13:48:31Z","updated_at":"2025-09-18T13:49:17Z","body":"@omarbenhamid Thanks a ton for your time, I appreciate it.\r\n\r\n> The global instructions have been abandoned as most agents (by the time) needed to be explicitly hinted to read them, and they did not do by default.\r\n\r\nI guess some of the models have gotten better. Testing this locally in our projects, the newer/smarter models seem to, mostly reliably (around 80% of the time), call the tool as instructed, and most of the ones that didn't succeed at first, query it after failing another tool call.\r\n\r\nThis is still not a perfect score of course, but I suspect, that as models continue to get better this will improve. The alternative would be to say that this score is not good enough to be upstream, in which case I would suggest removing this feature from the docs too to avoid confusion.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/3307567149/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/3384384565","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/45#issuecomment-3384384565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/45","id":3384384565,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOns7hc7JuZw1","user":{"login":"ant-ms","id":23363161,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMzYzMTYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23363161?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms","html_url":"https://github.com/ant-ms","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ant-ms/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T06:52:37Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T06:52:37Z","body":"@omarbenhamid Sorry for the ping, I know you're busy, however I believe that it might make sense to decide on a yes and merge this, or on a no and close this, instead of leaving this PR in limbo for much longer.\r\n\r\nIf you disagree with the feature, we can close this, and I can make a PR to remove the mentions of it from the docs. 